{"id":"memorial_201101","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial201100","label":"OLD TALES · Voice of Red Shoes"},"label":"※□＠■※","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_201101_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"Do you know?"},{"id":"memorial_201101_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"You've been chosen by the Raptures, or more specifically, by their Queen."},{"id":"memorial_201101_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"Not just anyone can become a Heretic."},{"id":"memorial_201101_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"Only Nikkes selected by the Queen can be reborn as Heretics."},{"id":"memorial_201101_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"By unfastening their personalities and replacing them with my own advanced personality data,"},{"id":"memorial_201101_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"I carefully guide Nikkes along the path to becoming Heretics."},{"id":"memorial_201101_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"Not every Nikke receives this honor."},{"id":"memorial_201101_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"So, Cinderella, take pride in yourself."},{"id":"memorial_201101_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"And always remember:"},{"id":"memorial_201101_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_04_01_description","text":"You were at your most beautiful when you were Anachiro."}]}